{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Resprite is a pixel art editor for crafting game assets and sprite animations. If you already use tools like GIMP, PhotoShop, iDraw3, Aseprite, or Pixelorama, you can pick it up immediately. Beyond standard editing features, Resprite offers:</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >1. Flexible user interface</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drag interface panels to any layout you like</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep essential tools close with customizable toolbars</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use floating windows whenever you need them</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quickly switch or fine-tune theme colors</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >2.\u00a0Rich timeline functions</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Focus on any animation clip with a single click</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use layers as clipping masks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assign blending modes and other properties to layer groups</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >3. Free-position color palette</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Organize palette groups however you like</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Generate smooth ramps via color interpolation</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >4. More Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interactive curve tool</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embedded reference images in documents</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Export bead patterns</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Export PSD files</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Export video</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Timelapse recordings of your drawing process</p></li></ul><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beyond the Steam desktop release, Resprite is also available on iOS and Android. Join the community to share artwork, trade tips, and suggest new features.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3146020?t=1763182252","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3146020?t=1763182252","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3146020/d45d7e7f4d43fbd37174becf0b77a705800fab4a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763182252","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3146020/d45d7e7f4d43fbd37174becf0b77a705800fab4a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763182252","content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Resprite is a pixel art editor for crafting game assets and sprite animations. If you already use tools like GIMP, PhotoShop, iDraw3, Aseprite, or Pixelorama, you can pick it up immediately. Beyond standard editing features, Resprite offers:</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >1. Flexible user interface</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drag interface panels to any layout you like</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep essential tools close with customizable toolbars</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use floating windows whenever you need them</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quickly switch or fine-tune theme colors</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >2.\u00a0Rich timeline functions</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Focus on any animation clip with a single click</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use layers as clipping masks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assign blending modes and other properties to layer groups</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >3. Free-position color palette</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Organize palette groups however you like</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Generate smooth ramps via color interpolation</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >4. More Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interactive curve tool</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embedded reference images in documents</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Export bead patterns</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Export PSD files</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Export video</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Timelapse recordings of your drawing process</p></li></ul><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beyond the Steam desktop release, Resprite is also available on iOS and Android. Join the community to share artwork, trade tips, and suggest new features.</p>","developers":["Fengeon"],"genres":[{"description":"Design & Illustration","id":"53"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3146020/6bf544277fe65826ba63bc2a44d91a64b3412e7c/header.jpg?t=1763182252","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"(C) 2024-2025 Fengeon Software","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires an Apple processor<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple Silicon<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires an Apple processor<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> 14<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple Silicon<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 20 GB available space</li></ul>"},"name":"Resprite","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","subs":[{"can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"option_description":"","option_text":"Resprite - $13.99 USD","packageid":1116836,"percent_savings":0,"percent_savings_text":" ","price_in_cents_with_discount":1399}],"title